### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ARCHIVE DELETION REQUESTS WORKFLOW (NEW)
### Base Route: api/archive-deletion-requests
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@departmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@targetFolderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@targetRecordId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. SUBMIT DELETE REQUEST (for a Folder)
### TargetType: 0 = Folder, 1 = Record
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": 0,
  "targetId": "{{targetFolderId}}",
  "justification": "This folder contains outdated records that need to be removed per retention policy."
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. SUBMIT DELETE REQUEST (for a Record)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": 1,
  "targetId": "{{targetRecordId}}",
  "justification": "This record is duplicated and no longer needed."
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET DELETE REQUEST BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. GET PENDING REQUESTS FOR DEPARTMENT (NEW)
### Requires DepartmentHead authorization
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests/department/{{departmentId}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. APPROVE DELETE REQUEST (NEW)
### Requires DepartmentHead authorization
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Approved. The target is verified and can be deleted."
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. REJECT DELETE REQUEST (NEW)
### Requires DepartmentHead authorization
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "The target still contains active records. Reconsider after archiving."
}
